        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaung'a na wukomboli ghwa Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bugha kwa Jerusalemu, muzi ghunonekie ghuleghagha kumsikira Mlungu na kukoronga wandu wake weni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndeghumsikiragha BWANA hata kurumiria makosa ghake. Ndeghumrumiriagha BWANA hata kulola wutesia ghwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaa wake weeka sa shimba irurumagha na watanyi wake sa vikwau viko njala, vijagha kwa lwafuo visedimagha kusighara hata indi nakesho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walodi wake ni wa tee, wandu wisena wuloli; wakohani wake wadalusha vilambo va wueli, na kughalusa sharia ra Mlungu kwa fwaida rawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela BWANA ni mhachi andenyi ya ugho muzi, ndebonyagha makosa; wadawonyera hachi yake kwa wandu wake nakesho hata nakenyi. Ela wandu wiseko na hachi wadachuria kubonya makosa hata ndewifwagha waya anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Nameria kuritotesha mbari zima rose; namerie kuinona mizi yawo, mawurigha gharo na minara yawo. Chia rawo reesighwa nduu, ndekuwadie mndungi aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neregheshereghe wandu wapo wichanitala, winughe mawonyero na mafundisho ghapo kuseko kuliwa. Ela shwa wori wikaazama kuchumba imbiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa huwo weseria ituku niwukagha kushitakia iro mbari ra wandu. Nakatire shauri ekwanya iro mbari na mawuzuri niriwonyere ndighi ya machu ghapo. Ndoenyi kose kuchatoteshwa ni modo ghwa lubio lwapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niko nicharighalua mbari ra wandu wipate kunitasa ini niekeri, hata si milungu mizima anduangi. Wandu wose wichanisikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufuma kimonu cha meda ya Kushi, wandu wapo wisasarikie wichacha na kuniredia mafunyo ghapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, ndemchaafushwa waya wei morenileghieghe. Nichainja wandu wose werekukasagha na kukuduka, nenyo ndemchaanilegha sena aighu ya mghondi ghwapo ghwa wueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nichasigha wandu wikuserie na wa mboa aho, awo wilolagha wulindiri ghwapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wa Israeli wichaasigharika ndewichaam'bonyera mndungi makosa, hata kughora tee, angu kukalia. Wichakaia nicha, wiko na wulindiri ghukate, hata ndewichaamuobua mndungi anduangi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
